-- args
format --stdin-file-path input.md --wrap 72
-- stdin
`ir` focuses on two workflows:

- running or rendering self-describing scripts and
  documents (`ir run`, `ir render`)
- running or installing command-line tools distributed through R
  packages (`rx`, `ir tool install`)
